        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: the commander of the First Division, a general in the early Imperial Japanese Army\n- Organizations: First Division, Japanese Second Army, Imperial Japanese Army\n- Events: Port Arthur massacre\n- Places: Port Arthur, China\n\nFacts:\n- The Port Arthur massacre took place in Port Arthur, China.\n- The Japanese Second Army was involved at the Port Arthur massacre.\n- The First Division was part of the Japanese Second Army at the Port Arthur massacre.\n- The commander was in charge of the First Division at the Port Arthur massacre.\n- The commander was a general in the early Imperial Japanese Army.\n- The early Imperial Japanese Army belonged to the Imperial Japanese Army.",
